<view class="ew-page ew-screen" style="font-size:{{14 * fontScale}}px"><view class="ew-heading">个人资料</view><view class="ew-subtitle">修改完成后保存，返回时不会自动提交。</view><view class="ew-card"><button class="avatar-btn" open-type="chooseAvatar" disabled="{{busy}}" bindchooseavatar="onChooseAvatar"><image wx:if="{{userInfo.avatar}}" src="{{userInfo.avatar}}" class="avatar-img" mode="aspectFill" binderror="onAvatarError" /><view wx:else class="avatar-placeholder">我</view></button><view class="ew-muted">点击选择微信头像，上传后用于个人资料展示</view><view class="ew-field"><view class="ew-label">昵称</view><input class="ew-input" type="nickname" maxlength="64" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="onNicknameInput" disabled="{{busy}}" /></view><view class="ew-muted">已使用 {{joinDays}} 天</view><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="ew-error">{{errorMessage}}</view><view class="ew-actions"><ui-button label="取消" variant="secondary" disabled="{{busy}}" bind:action="onCancel" /><ui-button label="保存资料" loading="{{busy}}" bind:action="onSave" /></view></view></view>
